        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CHA2517, 2-1/2\" x 1-3/4\" Adjustable Hinge with Ball Tips</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, the 2-1/2 Inch 1-3/4 Inch Adjustable Cabinet Hinge is constructed to last. It measures 2-1/2 inches high and 1-3/4 inches wide. Sold as a pair, the Deltana CHA2517 lightweight door hinge comes packaged with matching solid brass Phillips flathead screws #7x3/4 inch. The ball tip finials come standard but they can easily be interchanged by any of the Deltana cabinet finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=341823\">Deltana's Cabinet Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana CHA2517 Adjustable 2-1/2 Inch Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: #7x3/4\" Phillips flathead screw (included)</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair</li>\r\n<li>Finials: Ball Tip (included)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHA2517-Specifications.pdf?v=1691095318\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CHA2517 Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
